.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts-102- *
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts-103- * What it does:
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts-104- * 1. Reorders Pi's system prompt so stable content is sent before dynamic context.
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts-105- * 2. Sets PI_CACHE_RETENTION=long at extension load time.
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts:106: * 3. Warns once for provider/model cache compat gaps where the signal is conservative.
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts-107- * 4. Shows lightweight persisted provider-specific cache stats in Pi's footer.
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts-108- *
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts-109- * Provider prompt/KV caches are provider-side and best-effort. This extension improves
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/index.ts-110- * the odds of cache hits; it cannot guarantee hits, especially through proxies.
--
