specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md-100-## 5. TESTING
specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md-101-
specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md-102-Per item: one test that fails before and passes after, and one negative control. Specifically —
specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md:103:W1: `{input:500}` with no cache fields increments `unmeasuredRequests` and `totalInputTokens`,
specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md-104-records cost, and leaves `hitRequests` and the measured denominator untouched; controls are an
specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md-105-explicit `{cacheRead:0,cacheWrite:0,totalInput:500}` counting as one measured miss, and
specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md-106-`usage === undefined` adding nothing. W2: a zero rate prices, missing and negative stay unpriced.
specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md:107:W3: a model declaring no cache reporting lands in unmeasured, an unset flag changes nothing.
specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md-108-W4: an A/A/B/B turn sequence lifts only on the second observation, with session and model isolation.
specs/hooks/019-cache-optimizer-measurement-fixes/plan.md-109-W5: after a matching 400 and a restart, the next request omits the key without a second 400.
