 *
 *   1. XML-style opening tags  `<tagname>` (lowercase, alpha-num + `_`/`-`)
 *   2. XML-style closing tags  `</tagname>`
 *   3. HTML comment START/END  `<!-- NAME:START -->` / `<!-- NAME:END -->`
