codex
The fallback fix passes its handler test. The reset test exposed a test-fixture issue rather than a product defect: `model-a` does not match an adapter, so the existing command intentionally returns before reset. I’m switching that fixture to the adapter-matching `gpt-5.5` model, then I’ll rerun the negative and positive checks.
