.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/README.md-457-pi remove npm:pi-cache-optimizer
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/README.md-458-```
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/README.md-459-
.pi/extensions/pi-cache-optimizer/README.md-460-Then run `/reload` or restart Pi. Optional local state cleanup (if you use `PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR`, delete the same files from that directory instead):
